Description: Present the Microsoft EULA and honour refusal before downloading
Origin: backport, https://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/multiverse/m/msttcorefonts/msttcorefonts_3.8.1ubuntu2.tar.xz
Author: Michael Vogt
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/670629
Forwarded: not-needed
Comment: Ubuntu 3.3ubuntu1 introduced the EULA prompt. Adapt its default-false
 check to Debian config/postinst, retaining Debian synchronous download and retry.
 The edition does not use Ubuntu update-notifier downloads.

